# Keeps the Docker build context to tracked files. Every entry mirrors an
# untracked entry in a .gitignore, the root one or a nested one (dependency
# trees, local environment files, build and test output, editor and
# per-machine tool state), plus git history. The Dockerfile's `COPY . /app`
# stages would otherwise copy them into the build layers; the image installs
# its own dependencies and builds its own output. Patterns here anchor at the
# context root, so an entry that can appear at any depth carries a `**/`
# prefix. Keep this file in step with the .gitignore files.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# react-router
.cache
build
public/build
**/.react-router

# Editors and OS
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Logs and tool caches
**/logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.npm
**/.eslintcache
**/.jest-cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Testing and Storybook output
playwright
.playwright/.cache
.playwright/output
**/.playwright-cli
**/coverage
storybook-static

# Per-machine Claude and GAIA state
.claude/agent-memory
.claude/worktrees
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/react-doctor
**/.claude-pr
.claude/wiki-drift-checked
.claude/wiki-safety-checked
.claude/wiki-recompact-pending
.gaia/local
.gaia/local.bak.*
.gaia/statusline/.use-vendored-base
**/.gaia-backup
**/.gaia-merge
**/.bats-shards-scratch.*
.husky/_
.serena/cache
.serena/project.local.yml
